      "kind": "claim",
      "subject": "change:20261029-itw-c3-stats-card-spec-rendered#why",
      "content": {
        "summary": "change:20261029-itw-c3-stats-card-spec-rendered why = \"The browser test for the stats card expected Quantum and Radiance to be drawn by ship-stats.js with eight lines. Since C3 renders those two pilot cards from statements, they carry nine lines (IMO added) and ship-stats.js rightly leaves them alone, so the spec failed (Tools Smoke on InTheWake #2672).\"",
        "ref": null,
        "hash": null
      },
